<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 423)</h2>
<p><b>Two review-room papercuts fixed.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Double-clicking the (invisible) title-bar strip now zooms the window, per system convention.</li>
<li>While comparing, the notes composer shows an amber strip naming exactly which clip your note will land on.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
